<title>SINGAPORE: Taiwan tenders to buy 72,000/T February fuel oil.</title>
<headline>Taiwan tenders to buy 72,000/T February fuel oil.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Chinese Petroluem Corp (CPC) has issued a tender to buy two 38,000 tonnes cargoes of 0.5 percent sulphur fuel oil for February delivery, a company official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>CPC seeks one high pour cargo for delivery to Kaohsiung between February 6-25 and one low pour cargo for February 1-20 delivery to Keelung or Taichung.</p>
<p>The tender closes on January 15 and is valid until January 16.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
</text>
